node_modules/
dist/
out/
# A hand-run `tsc` (or a copy step) can leave compiled JavaScript at the
# repository root, where it looks like source and never changes again once
# committed. Output belongs in a `dist/` directory; see
# tests/contract/repo-root.test.ts.
/bootstrap.js
/bootstrap.js.map
release/
# `docs/release/` holds the feed document that is waiting to be uploaded as a
# release asset, not build output — the packaging directory above is ignored,
# this one is committed on purpose.
!/docs/release/
*.tsbuildinfo
.ucad-data/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
.env
.env.*
coverage/
.vitest/
# The scratch directory `npm run test:local` uses on machines whose /tmp is a
# quota-limited tmpfs; see docs/blockers.md 「本机全量测试的已知环境约束」.
.tmp/

.run-logs/
.shots/
